			<div class="col-md-8 order-first">
				<p>Jenny hand-carry air compressors come in both electric and gas models. Their electric compressors are great for the homeowner, do-it-yourselfer, and small contractor where power supply is available. Jenny gas models are ideal for use around the jobsite and on the go, especially where a power supply is not available.</p>
				<p>These compressors can handle a variety of attachments, from air tools to blow guns. Jenny has made a wide variety of compressor specifications available, so you are sure to find one that suits your needs.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="col-sm-12" style="margin-bottom:15px;">
				<div class="row">
					<div class="col-sm-4">
						<b>Standard Features</b>
						<ul>
							<li>Aluminum head for better heat dissipation</li>
							<li>Powder coated heavy duty steel tank and frame assembly</li>
							<li>Single stage, direct coupled, oil lubricated pump</li>
							<li>Cast iron cylinder for extended pump life</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="col-sm-4">
						<b>Electric Units</b>
						<ul>
							<li>Start/Stop pressure switch control set at 105-125 PSI</li>
							<li>On/Off Switch</li>
							<li>Thermal overload motor protection with manual reset</li>
							<li>6 ft power cord</li>
						</ul>
					</div>
					<div class="col-sm-4">
						<b>Gasoline Unites</b>
						<ul>
							<li>High quality pilot valve</li>
							<li>Pneumatic throttle idle control</li>
							<li>Constant run control set at 105-125 PSI</li>
							<li>Recoil start Honda GX Series OHV Engine</li>
						</ul>
