					<div class="col-sm-9">
						<h4>Jenny 2 Horse Power 4 Gallon Electric Hand Carry - AM780-HC4V</h4>
						<p>
							The AM780-HC4V is Jenny's most popular hand-carry electric air compressor. The AM780 features and Aluminum
							head and cast iron cylinders, each of which results in a longer pump life. This compressor is Single stage,
							direct coupled, and features an oil lubricated pump with Jenny Ultimate Blue Synthetic Compressor Pump Oil. All
							of this is combined in a Lightweight, compact, and extremely portable.
						</p>
