					</div>
					<div class="col-sm-9">
						<h4>Jenny 4 Horse Power 4 Gallon Hand-Carry Gas - AM840-4HG-HC4V</h4>
						<p>
							The AM840 air compressor is known for being one of the best hand-carry gas compressors in the industry. This
							unit features a recoil start Honda GX Series OHV Engine - know for their top performance and reliability. The 840
							has a pneumatic throttle idle control, and has its constant run control set at 105-125 PSI. This Jenny also has
							anti-vibration feet, and a cast iron cylinder for extended pump life .
						</p>
