						<h4>Jenny 2 Horse Power 5.3 Gallon Wheeled Compressor - A2G246-HC5H</h4>
						<p>
							This Jenny &quot;Air 2 Go&quot; air compressor is specifically designed for the homeowner or contractor who is
							looking for a quality portable air compressor. It features a heavy duty 5.3 Gallon steel tank, and has a single
							stage, direct coupled, and oil lubricated pump. This wheeled air compressor also has a regulator and two gauges
							for line and tank pressure, so the user is always aware of his current pressure settings.
						</p>
